{"name":"BrowserInfo.md","path":"typedoc/core/browser/detect/interfaces/BrowserInfo.md","format":"markdown","html":"<article class=\"docs-md\"><p><a href=\"../../../../README.md\"><strong>luiskr.com</strong></a></p>\n<hr>\n<p><a href=\"../../../../README.md\">luiskr.com</a> / <a href=\"../README.md\">core/browser/detect</a> / BrowserInfo</p>\n<p>Defined in: <a href=\"https://github.com/LuisKrotz/luiskr.com-V3/blob/214965eca24f91b1469ed21eb399bf941ad49ce0/core/browser/detect.ts#L29\">core/browser/detect.ts:29</a></p>\n<p>Resolved engine identity — name, marketing major version, quirks.</p>\n<h2 id=\"extends\">Extends</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"../../browsers/interfaces/BrowserQuirks.md\"><code>BrowserQuirks</code></a></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"properties\">Properties</h2>\n<h3 id=\"webgpu\">webgpu?</h3>\n<pre><code class=\"language-ts\">optional webgpu?: boolean;\n</code></pre>\n<p>Defined in: <a href=\"https://github.com/LuisKrotz/luiskr.com-V3/blob/214965eca24f91b1469ed21eb399bf941ad49ce0/core/browser/browsers.ts#L17\">core/browser/browsers.ts:17</a></p>\n<p>navigator.gpu absent/flag-gated — the app skips the WebGPU init path.</p>\n<h4 id=\"inherited-from\">Inherited from</h4>\n<p><a href=\"../../browsers/interfaces/BrowserQuirks.md\"><code>BrowserQuirks</code></a>.<a href=\"../../browsers/interfaces/BrowserQuirks.md#webgpu\"><code>webgpu</code></a></p>\n<hr>\n<h3 id=\"lowgpu\">lowGpu?</h3>\n<pre><code class=\"language-ts\">optional lowGpu?: boolean;\n</code></pre>\n<p>Defined in: <a href=\"https://github.com/LuisKrotz/luiskr.com-V3/blob/214965eca24f91b1469ed21eb399bf941ad49ce0/core/browser/browsers.ts#L19\">core/browser/browsers.ts:19</a></p>\n<p>Mostly mid-range SoCs — renderers may start at reduced resolution scale.</p>\n<h4 id=\"inherited-from\">Inherited from</h4>\n<p><a href=\"../../browsers/interfaces/BrowserQuirks.md\"><code>BrowserQuirks</code></a>.<a href=\"../../browsers/interfaces/BrowserQuirks.md#lowgpu\"><code>lowGpu</code></a></p>\n<hr>\n<h3 id=\"name\">name</h3>\n<pre><code class=\"language-ts\">name: string\n</code></pre>\n<p>Defined in: <a href=\"https://github.com/LuisKrotz/luiskr.com-V3/blob/214965eca24f91b1469ed21eb399bf941ad49ce0/core/browser/detect.ts#L30\">core/browser/detect.ts:30</a></p>\n<hr>\n<h3 id=\"major\">major</h3>\n<pre><code class=\"language-ts\">major: number\n</code></pre>\n<p>Defined in: <a href=\"https://github.com/LuisKrotz/luiskr.com-V3/blob/214965eca24f91b1469ed21eb399bf941ad49ce0/core/browser/detect.ts#L31\">core/browser/detect.ts:31</a></p>\n</article>","mtime":"2026-10-08T13:12:17.058Z"}